  "description": "Operating Area: France, Corsica, Sardinia, Italy, Balearic Sea\n\nNautor Swan shipyard, with a high-end specification from a passionate owner, built the 108-foot sailing yacht PS5 PLAYSTATION in 2023. This innovative hull is the result of precision work, quality and attention to detail, offering outstanding performance, elegant design and luxurious comfort. \n\nThis latest Swan maxi yacht has been designed and engineer for high speed sailing in all wind and sea conditions. She offers all her guests breath-taking sensations in comfortable and safe conditions, allowing the whole family to full enjoy their charter. \n\nPS5 PLAYSTATION can accommodate up to 9 people on board. Her interior features a Master suite, a VIP cabin and 2 twin cabins, one with an additional pullman bed and one convertible into a double. PS5 PLAYSTATION's large saloon, bathed in light through exceptionally large potholes, invites guests to relax in a refined and intimate atmosphere. The small lounge offers a playful space for board games and film nights. PS5 PLAYSTATION's specialised dining room allows guests to enjoy high-quality meals and service onboard. The crew have their own quarters and service entrance, which maintains privacy for guests. \n\nOn deck, PS5 PLAYSTATION has an exceptional swimming platforms, as well as spacious relaxation and dining areas, always elegant and preserving a high quality of service. ",
